# Real patient ticket photos and scans must NEVER be committed. Drop them in
# locally to test against; these patterns keep them out of git. The images are
# no longer masked before storage, so git is the only place this rule still
# applies — and it applies to the PDFs the team now sends as well as to phone
# photos, which is why *.pdf is here.
tests/fixtures/real/
*.jpeg
*.pdf
MH*.jpg
MO*.jpg
